    fields:  # 68ea
      statement: "Cross-language FFI linker edges must carry access_mode and dest_access_mode so the dataflow pass can evaluate them. Tier 1 automatic annotation cannot work across language boundaries."  # 68ea
      root_cause: "FFI linkers (cgo, jni, pyffi, napi, lua_ffi, ruby_ffi) all create bridge edges without access_mode. Only messaging/crypto linkers set it. Fix: add access_mode=write, dest_access_mode=read to all FFI bridge edge creation."  # 68ea
